                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6980f44f-10d4-3f2d-94eb-a040faea9365",
                        "entry_id": "b367cf15-5344-36cc-b1bd-828ac4e9a986",
                        "glosses": [
                            "wretch (an unhappy, unfortunate or miserable person)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine",
                            "person"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e7cf1ac-44dd-4a03-85b8-9b66d5a5249c",
                                "sense_id": "6980f44f-10d4-3f2d-94eb-a040faea9365",
                                "text": "Sieroty to były, stare żołnierzyska i bezdomne nieszczęśniki, wyzute z fortun gorzkimi ewentami losów i ludzką niepoczciwością.",
                                "translation": "They were orphans, old soldiers and homeless wretches, deprived of their fortunes by the bitter vicissitudes of fate and human unkindness.",
                                "english": "They were orphans, old soldiers and homeless wretches, deprived of their fortunes by the bitter vicissitudes of fate and human unkindness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4e79ba1-d717-4c52-a952-d7921e16a1b3",
                                "sense_id": "6980f44f-10d4-3f2d-94eb-a040faea9365",
                                "text": "– Wszystko będzie dobrze. Zobaczysz – pogładził ją po włosach. Rozpłakała się. Tulił ją mocno, sam ledwo sobie radząc z napływem sprzecznych uczuć. Westchnął – był najszczęśliwszym nieszczęśnikiem na Ziemi.",
                                "translation": "\"Everything will be alright. You'll see.\" He stroked her hair. She burst into tears. He hugged her tightly, barely managing the flood of conflicting emotions himself. He sighed—he was the happiest wretch on Earth.",
                                "english": "\"Everything will be alright. You'll see.\" He stroked her hair. She burst into tears. He hugged her tightly, barely managing the flood of conflicting emotions himself. He sighed—he was the happiest wretch on Earth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d8fb853-5081-4b07-9f15-0b8e1390c017",
                                "sense_id": "6980f44f-10d4-3f2d-94eb-a040faea9365",
                                "text": "Efekt był taki, że nieszczęśnicy przeważnie ponuro milczeli i tylko popatrywali spode łbów to na siebie nawzajem, to na ekrany.",
                                "translation": "The result was that the unfortunate people mostly remained gloomy and silent and just looked from under their heads, sometimes at each other, sometimes at the screens.",
                                "english": "The result was that the unfortunate people mostly remained gloomy and silent and just looked from under their heads, sometimes at each other, sometimes at the screens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3ac472e-7b8a-4563-aa5e-70da89db4871",
                                "sense_id": "6980f44f-10d4-3f2d-94eb-a040faea9365",
                                "text": "-I wyciągnął półlitrówkę z bimbrem. - Masz, napij się, boś zsiniał. Bez wódki to tu nie ma co chodzić. Raz, że można uświerknąć, a po drugie, mogą ci się potem śnić te nieszczęśniki.",
                                "translation": "And he pulled out a half-liter bottle of moonshine. \"Here, drink up, you're turning blue. There's no point in going around here without vodka. Firstly, you might get high, and secondly, you might dream about those wretches later.\"",
                                "english": "And he pulled out a half-liter bottle of moonshine. \"Here, drink up, you're turning blue. There's no point in going around here without vodka. Firstly, you might get high, and secondly, you might dream about those wretches later.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
